AN EPIC IS NOT A LIST OF RECORDS: do not count the ages in order ("in Age 37… in Age 38…" is FORBIDDEN; mention an age number a few times at most); choose three or four turning points, make every paragraph a scene, bind events by cause. Do not write numbers, counts of followers or soldiers, ranks or levels, essence, renown, stats, tool or engine names; do not copy the son's speech tics, quote at most one of their sayings briefly. Do not write record numbers.
